{
  "_comment": [
    "Which tests a change runs. Read by Scripts/select_tests.py (CI's plan job) and Scripts/check_ui_shards.py.",
    "ui_shards: the XCUITest split. Every UI test method must be selected by exactly one shard.",
    "smoke_shard: added to every run that selects any UI shard.",
    "ui_classes_by_target: for each module the app links, the UI test classes its changes run; \"all\" runs every shard.",
    "full_paths: a change here runs everything (unit suites, every UI shard, the Release build).",
    "linux_only_paths: a change here needs no macOS job; the Linux job always runs.",
    "cli_paths: a change here runs the macOS build and CLI end-to-end checks without unit or UI tests.",
    "Any path matched by none of these and owned by no Tuist target runs everything."
  ],
  "smoke_shard": 1,
